    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Weapon (Dagger), Rare</em></p><p>You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon.</p><p><strong>Identify Target.</strong> When you hit a creature with an attack roll using this weapon, you can compel the target to reveal its identity. The target makes a DC 15 Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the target says or signs its name clearly and emphatically. On a successful save, the target is immune to this effect for the next 24 hours. If the creature can’t speak or sign a language, it automatically succeeds on the save.</p><p><strong>Named Target.</strong> When you hit a creature with an attack roll using this weapon, you can say or sign the target’s name clearly and emphatically to turn the hit into a Critical Hit. Once this property is used, it can’t be used again until the next dawn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-CPcSOERTb2OH8zv5\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Named Target</em> compte son utilisation par aube : relancez vous-même les dégâts du coup en critique.</p></section>",
